      "summary": {
        "en": "The framework's extension point for model-visible wording: pick the language the framework's own clauses arrive in, and replace any catalog key's clause wholesale, without forking the framework.",
        "zh": "框架为「模型可见文案」留的扩展点：选定框架自身文案的语言，并整段替换目录里任一键的措辞，不必分叉框架。"
